{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">\ud83e\udd96 <strong>Dino Hazard: Chronos Blackout</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A time-travel dinosaur JRPG \u2014 created by real paleontologists.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After a mysterious blackout, a high-tech island spirals into chaos: prehistoric creatures are unleashed, rogue AIs take control, and shadowy corporations pull the strings.<br>Lead a diverse team of survivors, face moral choices of <strong>HATE or LOVE</strong>, and decide the fate of Chronos Island.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2728 <strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae <strong>90s-inspired JRPG</strong> \u2014 blending the spirit of <i>Chrono Trigger, Phantasy Star, Undertale,</i> and <i>Dino Crisis</i>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udd95 <strong>Scientifically accurate dinosaurs</strong> \u2014 reconstructed with real paleontology consulting.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc65 <strong>7 playable characters</strong> \u2014 each with unique abilities, styles, and backstories.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde9 <strong>Moral choices of HATE or LOVE</strong> \u2014 influence the world around you and unlock multiple endings.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf0d <strong>A living island to explore</strong> \u2014 distinct ecosystems, hidden secrets, and futuristic facilities to restore.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u23f1\ufe0f <strong>Long playtime</strong> \u2014</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Main story: 30+ hours</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story + side quests: 50+ hours</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Completionist (Dinodex, secrets, endings): 90+ hours</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfb6 <strong>Original soundtrack</strong> \u2014 nostalgic and epic, also available in the Deluxe bundle.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udce2 <strong>What the media says</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\u201cUndertale, Jurassic Park and Phantasy Star collide in a time-traveling dinosaur JRPG.\u201d</i> \u2014 <strong>GamesRadar</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\u201cA remarkable RPG. Beautiful art, amazing music, and an emotional story.\u201d</i> \u2014 <strong>Grinding Cast</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\u201cIt feels nostalgic yet fresh. If you love dinosaurs, this game is perfect for you.\u201d</i> \u2014 <strong>IGN</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udca1 <strong>Real-world impact</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Part of the profits from <i>Dino Hazard</i> go directly into <strong>scientific research in paleontology</strong>, supporting studies on real dinosaur fossils.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc49 <strong>Choose your path. Restore the future. Survive the blackout.</strong></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Command Center","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1287540/0f6306eccf78679cfce725cf169fa45f6ae7fd2e.jpg"},{"name":"First Droid","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1287540/7dac272cf7efc315450551f69ea56c2f645809ab.jpg"},{"name":"Radio Tower","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1287540/f45c2391161e7833fb54ccd027feb6f28b46f1a2.jpg"},{"name":"Part I","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1287540/b8a7121d6d02abc362a4aebddea2742c56c51f1e.jpg"},{"name":"Hospital","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1287540/426c3db368587201d8132cca2417988dcb4c492e.jpg"},{"name":"Part II","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1287540/92658904cfa963314f79e7c85ffd68947a4bad82.jpg"},{"name":"Part III","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1287540/f