_tag\" >\ud83d\udce2 <strong>What the media says</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\u201cUndertale, Jurassic Park and Phantasy Star collide in a time-traveling dinosaur JRPG.\u201d</i> \u2014 <strong>GamesRadar</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\u201cA remarkable RPG. Beautiful art, amazing music, and an emotional story.\u201d</i> \u2014 <strong>Grinding Cast</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\u201cIt feels nostalgic yet fresh. If you love dinosaurs, this game is perfect for you.\u201d</i> \u2014 <strong>IGN</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udca1 <strong>Real-world impact</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Part of the profits from <i>Dino Hazard</i> go directly into <strong>scientific research in paleontology</strong>, supporting studies on real dinosaur fossils.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc49 <strong>Choose your path. Restore the future. Survive the blackout.</strong></p>","developers":["Bone Collectors"],"dlc":[1545950],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1287540/dfa65542548f0021fe6788d4010143c8c7ec392b/header.jpg?t=1768325747","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"Dino Hazard: Chronos Blackout \u00a9 2020 Tito Aureliano & Aline Ghilardi.<br />\r\nDINO HAZARD \u00a9 2018 Tito Aureliano. <br />\r\nDINO HAZARD is a registered trademark of Tito Aureliano. <br />\r\n\u00a9 2017 BONE COLLECTORS.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core2 Duo or better<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> OpenGL 4.1 capable GPU<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> This game is meant to run on 60 Hz monitors. Running it on higher frequencies may cause unexpected issues.</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong